## 539. 固定有限机器的前缀紧致性

```lean
theorem bounded_global_model_iff_all_prefix_models
    [Fintype Alphabet]
    [Fintype Output]
    [Fintype BaseState]
    (problem : SparseProblem Alphabet Output BaseState)
    (bound : ℕ) :
    HasGlobalModelAtMost problem bound ↔
      ∀ extent,
        HasPrefixModelAtMost problem extent bound
```

需要对状态命名规范化并证明候选机器类型有限。

